      "writtenOn": "2021-09-14T18:01:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The difference in the build outputs is that linkstatic is no longer mentioned in blueprints or BUILDs, as reflected in the test changes. There doesn\u0027t seem to be a functional change in my testing... As you note, we were always just propagating this as true for static. It came up when doing the cc_library_shared work; there, I would\u0027ve likewise had to artificially plumb `linkstatic \u003d false` throughout the Go and .bzl. This was deemed undesirable.",
      "parentUuid": "28543b53_b630993f",
